WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.836
♪♪

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:05.004
Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:07.841
President Biden was photographed
on Thursday

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:10.209
picking a dandelion
from the White House lawn

00:00:10.209 --> 00:00:12.378
and giving it
to First Lady Dr. Jill Biden,

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:14.380
and right about there is when

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.415
Kamala Harris called
for a Bible.

00:00:16.415 --> 00:00:17.884
"Oop!
False alarm!

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:19.652
Nope.
He's getting back up.

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:22.088
Yep.
No, just picking a flower."

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:23.957
The Kentucky Derby
was this weekend.

00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:25.125
"And they're off!"

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:27.760
said Americans, about their TVs.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.296
According to his advisors,
former President Trump

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:32.999
is still challenging the results
of the 2020 election

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:36.635
and has called for a hand
recount of 2 million ballots

00:00:36.635 --> 00:00:38.271
cast in Arizona's
largest county,

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:40.239
which brings us
to a segment called

00:00:40.239 --> 00:00:44.177
"Seth Tries to Think
of Literally Anything
More Pathetic."

00:00:44.177 --> 00:00:47.313
♪♪

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:50.349
Asking your mom to prom?

00:00:50.349 --> 00:00:51.650
No.

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:56.155
Helping the guy your wife had
an affair move?

00:00:56.155 --> 00:00:57.757
No.
Asking your mom to prom

00:00:57.757 --> 00:01:00.894
and she's already going
with someone else?

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:03.429
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.429 --> 00:01:05.197
No, I can't do it.

00:01:05.197 --> 00:01:06.833
-This has been...

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:10.937
-I cannot believe Scollins
wrote that joke

00:01:10.937 --> 00:01:12.005
and then did the voice-over.

00:01:12.005 --> 00:01:14.340
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.142
Is there anyone --

00:01:16.142 --> 00:01:22.982
Is there anyone working here
on quality control?

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:24.383
[ Laughs ]

00:01:24.383 --> 00:01:26.385
And a real flat read, too.

00:01:26.385 --> 00:01:27.887
[ Laughter ]
Let's be honest.

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:29.521
It's not like --

00:01:29.521 --> 00:01:32.725
It's not like he's
our staff's Morgan Freeman.

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:35.628
"Well, we had to let him do it.

00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:38.931
I can't believe he wasn't busy
with other voice-over work."

00:01:38.931 --> 00:01:41.633
♪♪

00:01:41.633 --> 00:01:44.404
President Biden said last week
that he was not given

00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:47.073
advance notice of the raid
on former President Trump's

00:01:47.073 --> 00:01:49.242
personal attorney
Rudy Giuliani's home,

00:01:49.242 --> 00:01:50.710
and I would have believed him,

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:53.646
if he hadn't had popcorn all
over his suit.

00:01:53.646 --> 00:01:56.282
U.S. troops began their
withdrawal last week

00:01:56.282 --> 00:01:59.452
from Afghanistan after nearly
20 years occupying the country.

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:03.122
To give you an idea
of how long that is...

00:02:03.122 --> 00:02:05.925
That's right -- U.S. troops
began their withdrawal

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:07.626
last week from Afghanistan.

00:02:07.626 --> 00:02:10.430
Biden has plenty of reasons,
but number one is definitely

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:12.932
those YouTube videos where they
surprise a dog.

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:13.933
[ As Biden ]
Aww!

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:16.135
Dang it, gets me every time!

00:02:16.135 --> 00:02:18.070
Former president Trump
was reportedly presented

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:21.140
with a 24-page proposal
to launch his own

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:23.243
multibillion-dollar
media company

00:02:23.243 --> 00:02:26.045
and, under his leadership,
in a few years, it could become

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:29.548
a multimillion-dollar company.

00:02:29.548 --> 00:02:31.717
After visiting former
President Jimmy Carter

00:02:31.717 --> 00:02:34.186
at his home on Thursday,
President Biden told reporters

00:02:34.186 --> 00:02:37.056
that they, "Sat and talked
about the old days."

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:38.724
Like when they worked
side-by-side

00:02:38.724 --> 00:02:41.594
to try to bring down crime
and gas prices

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:43.328
and that mammoth.

00:02:43.328 --> 00:02:44.463
According to Politico,

00:02:44.463 --> 00:02:47.200
17% of President Biden's
White House staffers

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:49.502
have degrees
from Harvard University.

00:02:49.502 --> 00:02:51.070
Said the other 83%,

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:52.905
"Uh, we know."

00:02:52.905 --> 00:02:54.240
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:57.377
Authorities in Pennsylvania
announced last week

00:02:57.377 --> 00:02:59.511
that they arrested a man
after they discovered

00:02:59.511 --> 00:03:02.381
$1 million worth
of crystal meth,

00:03:02.381 --> 00:03:04.250
six so-called ghost guns,

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:06.719
and Nazi paraphernalia
during a raid.

00:03:06.719 --> 00:03:08.454
And, now, the man
is trying to decide

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:10.422
if he should accept a plea deal

00:03:10.422 --> 00:03:13.125
or just go ahead
and run for Congress.

00:03:13.125 --> 00:03:16.061
The NYPD recently announced
that it will no longer use

00:03:16.061 --> 00:03:18.464
its controversial
so-called robot dog

00:03:18.464 --> 00:03:19.698
and, once again,

00:03:19.698 --> 00:03:22.301
Travis stepped up to the plate.

00:03:22.301 --> 00:03:25.405
-He was my dog.

00:03:25.405 --> 00:03:26.539
I'll do it.

00:03:26.539 --> 00:03:32.145
[ Laughter ]

00:03:35.281 --> 00:03:37.650
-Real hot Monday for Scollins.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:39.051
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.051 --> 00:03:42.554
And, finally, the Italian
motorcycle company Benelli

00:03:42.554 --> 00:03:46.492
recently launched a new scooter,
called the Dong,

00:03:46.492 --> 00:03:48.361
and it's a pretty good scooter,

00:03:48.361 --> 00:03:49.729
except in cold weather.

00:03:49.729 --> 00:03:51.197
♪♪

00:03:51.197 --> 00:03:52.398
President Biden received

00:03:52.398 --> 00:03:54.366
the daily intelligence
briefing this morning.

00:03:54.366 --> 00:03:58.537
It was just, "So, they released
the Carter picture."

00:03:58.537 --> 00:04:00.206
[ Laughter ]
How is this the first

00:04:00.206 --> 00:04:03.309
we're hearing about the Bidens
being 40 feet tall?

00:04:03.309 --> 00:04:05.377
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.377 --> 00:04:07.813
They look like
a ventriloquist act.

00:04:07.813 --> 00:04:10.282
You know that dandelion picture
from the other day?

00:04:10.282 --> 00:04:11.884
That was an oak tree.

00:04:11.884 --> 00:04:13.586
[ Laughter ]
It was announced yesterday

00:04:13.586 --> 00:04:14.921
that President Biden
will deliver

00:04:14.921 --> 00:04:17.022
the commencement address
later this month

00:04:17.022 --> 00:04:19.525
at the U.S. Coast Guard
Academy graduation.

00:04:19.525 --> 00:04:22.494
And, while we're on the subject,
is it too late to change

00:04:22.494 --> 00:04:24.864
your Major?
[ Laughter ]

00:04:24.864 --> 00:04:27.967
[ As Biden ]
Don't make me send you back
to Scranton!

00:04:27.967 --> 00:04:29.369
A White House announced
yesterday --

00:04:29.369 --> 00:04:32.371
excuse me, the White House,
or a White House.

00:04:32.371 --> 00:04:34.439
[ Laughter ]
We should stop being so specific

00:04:34.439 --> 00:04:36.642
about which one it is.

00:04:36.642 --> 00:04:39.045
The White House announced
yesterday that President Biden

00:04:39.045 --> 00:04:42.949
is raising the annual
refugee limit to 62,500.

00:04:42.949 --> 00:04:43.950
Also rising?

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.718
Tucker Carlson's blood pressure.

00:04:45.718 --> 00:04:48.587
[ Laughter ]
President Biden
asked fifth graders

00:04:48.587 --> 00:04:51.223
at an elementary school
in Virginia yesterday

00:04:51.223 --> 00:04:53.125
what they wanted to be
when they grew up.

00:04:53.125 --> 00:04:54.260
Said students,

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:55.661
"Covered by a healthcare plan

00:04:55.661 --> 00:04:57.830
that isn't tied
to my employment."

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:00.833
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis
yesterday suspended all

00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:03.002
of the state's coronavirus
restrictions, and said,

00:05:03.002 --> 00:05:05.638
"We are no longer
in a state of emergency,"

00:05:05.638 --> 00:05:07.306
adding,
"but it's still Florida, so,

00:05:07.306 --> 00:05:08.741
give it a couple of days."

00:05:08.741 --> 00:05:11.110
Microsoft founder Bill Gates
announced yesterday

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:13.679
that he and his wife, Melinda,
will get a divorce,

00:05:13.679 --> 00:05:15.481
after being married
for 27 years.

00:05:15.481 --> 00:05:17.282
Apparently,
it was an accumulation

00:05:17.282 --> 00:05:18.851
of lots of little things,

00:05:18.851 --> 00:05:21.587
like how Bill would never
empty the recycling.

00:05:21.587 --> 00:05:24.290
[ Laughter ]

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:27.093
That's what you get for hiring
people who used to work in IT.

00:05:27.093 --> 00:05:28.928
[ Laughter ]

00:05:28.928 --> 00:05:31.063
Researchers in Germany
recently named

00:05:31.063 --> 00:05:33.733
a new bacteria that is linked
to lung parasites

00:05:33.733 --> 00:05:36.269
after the Pokémon tool
Poké Balls

00:05:36.269 --> 00:05:38.103
because they're a similar shape.

00:05:38.103 --> 00:05:39.372
Said one German doctor --

00:05:39.372 --> 00:05:42.775
[ German accent ] Bad news.
Ve didn't catch 'em all.

00:05:42.775 --> 00:05:47.346
[ Laughter ]

00:05:47.346 --> 00:05:48.914
I should know.
I freestyled there.

00:05:48.914 --> 00:05:50.282
The joke was not
for a German doctor

00:05:50.282 --> 00:05:54.386
and, the last minute,
I was like, "You know what?

00:05:54.386 --> 00:05:57.056
Let's let it rip.

00:05:57.056 --> 00:05:59.091
What's the worst
that could happen?"

00:05:59.091 --> 00:06:00.826
And then, you saw

00:06:00.826 --> 00:06:02.728
what the worst was.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:02.728 --> 00:06:04.564
A man in England
was arrested last week

00:06:04.564 --> 00:06:07.299
after a four miles per hour
police chase,

00:06:07.299 --> 00:06:10.303
in a narrow boat on a canal,
that lasted for eight miles,

00:06:10.303 --> 00:06:12.571
which means that,
by the time they caught him,

00:06:12.571 --> 00:06:15.608
the statute of limitations
had run out.

00:06:15.608 --> 00:06:17.276
Eight people who were involved

00:06:17.276 --> 00:06:20.112
in the torch relay
for the Tokyo Olympic Games

00:06:20.112 --> 00:06:21.981
have tested positive
for the coronavirus.

00:06:21.981 --> 00:06:23.982
Well, it's hard news to hear,
but, at least,

00:06:23.982 --> 00:06:26.718
the contact tracing
will be easy.

00:06:26.718 --> 00:06:28.354
And, finally,
according to a new report,

00:06:28.354 --> 00:06:30.089
the number of customers
who subscribe

00:06:30.089 --> 00:06:32.191
to AOL's dial-up
Internet service is,

00:06:32.191 --> 00:06:33.926
"in the low thousands,"

00:06:33.926 --> 00:06:36.662
which is also their average age.

00:06:36.662 --> 00:06:38.030
♪♪

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:40.032
Facebook's Oversight Board
announced today

00:06:40.032 --> 00:06:42.067
that it will uphold
the company's decision

00:06:42.067 --> 00:06:44.403
to suspend former
President Trump's account.

00:06:44.403 --> 00:06:46.806
So whatever else
you think of the guy,

00:06:46.806 --> 00:06:49.242
he did find a way
to leave Facebook.

00:06:49.242 --> 00:06:50.543
President Biden
announced yesterday

00:06:50.543 --> 00:06:52.077
he will change the country's

00:06:52.077 --> 00:06:54.179
coronavirus vaccination
strategy.

00:06:54.179 --> 00:06:55.981
He's going
with reverse psychology.

00:06:55.981 --> 00:06:57.483
[ As Biden ]
Fine, don't get one.

00:06:57.483 --> 00:06:58.584
No one wants
to hang out with you

00:06:58.584 --> 00:07:01.654
in an indoor setting, anyway.

00:07:01.654 --> 00:07:03.589
In a new interview,
Republican Senator Josh Hawley

00:07:03.589 --> 00:07:06.158
said he does not regret
pumping his fist

00:07:06.158 --> 00:07:07.794
to cheer on the pro-Trump mob

00:07:07.794 --> 00:07:10.095
that stormed the Capitol
on January 6th.

00:07:10.095 --> 00:07:13.432
He honestly never thought
anyone would find him inspiring.

00:07:13.432 --> 00:07:15.067
Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell

00:07:15.067 --> 00:07:16.235
said recently that Republicans

00:07:16.235 --> 00:07:18.738
are willing to negotiate
with President Biden

00:07:18.738 --> 00:07:22.308
over his $2.3 trillion
infrastructure proposal.

00:07:22.308 --> 00:07:24.210
McConnell said there might be
some wiggle room

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:27.846
around the placement
of the decimal point.

00:07:27.846 --> 00:07:30.282
House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy said recently

00:07:30.282 --> 00:07:34.353
that the woke movement in this
country "has got to stop"

00:07:34.353 --> 00:07:36.656
because it has led
to an absolute epidemic

00:07:36.656 --> 00:07:39.625
of old white guys saying "woke."

00:07:39.625 --> 00:07:42.595
Second Gentleman Doug Emhoff
traveled to Pennsylvania today

00:07:42.595 --> 00:07:44.730
to meet
with small business owners,

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:46.999
as opposed to President Biden,
who spent the weekend

00:07:46.999 --> 00:07:50.269
meeting
with small peanut farmers.

00:07:50.269 --> 00:07:53.405
I'm sorry.
It's a weird picture.

00:07:53.405 --> 00:07:58.277
I fear to look,
yet I cannot turn away.

00:07:58.277 --> 00:07:59.912
President Biden said this week

00:07:59.912 --> 00:08:01.680
that, during his trip
to Europe in June,

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:03.215
he hopes and expects

00:08:03.215 --> 00:08:05.618
to meet with Russian
President Vladmir Putin.

00:08:05.618 --> 00:08:09.455
"That can be arranged," said
a paperweight on his desk.

00:08:09.455 --> 00:08:11.624
According to a match.com survey,

00:08:11.624 --> 00:08:14.527
71% of single people
have not had sex

00:08:14.527 --> 00:08:16.795
since the coronavirus
pandemic started,

00:08:16.795 --> 00:08:19.365
and 91% of married people.

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:23.235
What do you think, Shoemaker,
am I in the 9% or the 91%?

00:08:23.235 --> 00:08:24.337
-No, I know.

00:08:24.337 --> 00:08:27.006
[ Laughter ]

00:08:32.211 --> 00:08:33.980
-Shoemaker!

00:08:37.015 --> 00:08:39.485
Star quarterback Tom Brady
said recently

00:08:39.485 --> 00:08:41.787
that he would trade two
of his seven Super Bowl rings

00:08:41.787 --> 00:08:42.988
to have won a championship

00:08:42.988 --> 00:08:45.758
at the end of his 2007
undefeated season.

00:08:45.758 --> 00:08:47.927
"Sorry, but we already
made a deal,"

00:08:47.927 --> 00:08:50.128
said Satan.

00:08:50.128 --> 00:08:52.198
Producers have announced
a new spinoff

00:08:52.198 --> 00:08:53.666
of the "Law &amp; Order" series,

00:08:53.666 --> 00:08:55.468
entitled "Law &amp; Order
for the Defense."

00:08:55.468 --> 00:08:58.571
Turns out Dick Wolf isn't
even close to "dun-dun."

00:09:00.906 --> 00:09:04.109
Every time you think
we've used the "dun-dun"

00:09:04.109 --> 00:09:06.444
as a punch line for the last,

00:09:06.444 --> 00:09:08.681
it comes back around.

00:09:08.681 --> 00:09:10.782
According to new research,
eating more nuts

00:09:10.782 --> 00:09:13.585
can lead to weight loss
and better appetite control.

00:09:13.585 --> 00:09:15.721
[ Clattering ]

00:09:15.721 --> 00:09:19.057
Sorry, that was just every one
of my male writers

00:09:19.057 --> 00:09:20.927
trying to get
to cue cards first.

00:09:23.262 --> 00:09:27.500
A 1,692-foot-long
pedestrian suspension bridge

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:29.234
recently opened in Portugal

00:09:29.234 --> 00:09:31.571
and takes at least
four minutes to cross,

00:09:31.571 --> 00:09:34.440
not to mention
three pairs of underwear.

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:36.975
And, finally,
according to a new study,

00:09:36.975 --> 00:09:40.079
men with larger noses
may also have larger penises.

00:09:40.079 --> 00:09:41.514
In case you're wondering why

00:09:41.514 --> 00:09:43.749
this guy looks so smug
all the time.

00:09:43.749 --> 00:09:45.451
♪♪

00:09:45.451 --> 00:09:48.053
President Biden visited
a 70-year-old bridge

00:09:48.053 --> 00:09:49.588
in Lake Charles, Louisiana,
today

00:09:49.588 --> 00:09:52.190
while pitching his jobs
and infrastructure plan

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:54.393
because, if Biden's proof
of anything,

00:09:54.393 --> 00:09:56.395
it's how much good
a few thousand dollars

00:09:56.395 --> 00:09:58.597
in bridge work can do for you.

00:09:58.597 --> 00:10:00.465
President Biden went
to a Mexican restaurant

00:10:00.465 --> 00:10:02.834
in Washington yesterday
in honor of Cinco de Mayo.

00:10:02.834 --> 00:10:04.036
He had the enchiladas

00:10:04.036 --> 00:10:05.838
and Major had the mariachi band.

00:10:05.838 --> 00:10:07.172
[ Laughter ]

00:10:07.172 --> 00:10:09.308
Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell said yesterday

00:10:09.308 --> 00:10:11.576
that, "100% of my focus

00:10:11.576 --> 00:10:13.345
is on stopping
the Biden administration."

00:10:13.345 --> 00:10:16.315
Oh, really? I don't remember
seeing you there.

00:10:16.315 --> 00:10:17.683
Put your money
where your mouth is, bud.

00:10:17.683 --> 00:10:20.619
Also, where is your mouth?

00:10:20.619 --> 00:10:22.988
Allies of Rudy Giuliani
have reportedly asked

00:10:22.988 --> 00:10:24.923
former President Trump
to pay Giuliani

00:10:24.923 --> 00:10:27.393
for representing him
through the 2020 election.

00:10:27.393 --> 00:10:30.328
Um, do they know
what kind of job he did?

00:10:30.328 --> 00:10:32.665
That's like the captain
of the Titanic asking,

00:10:32.665 --> 00:10:36.167
"So, where do I
submit my invoice?"

00:10:36.167 --> 00:10:38.637
A woman was recently arrested
at the Atlanta airport

00:10:38.637 --> 00:10:41.440
after officials discovered
3 pounds of cocaine

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:43.575
hidden in the bottom
of seven pairs of shoes.

00:10:43.575 --> 00:10:46.212
In her defense, 3 pounds
of cocaine is the only way

00:10:46.212 --> 00:10:49.015
to make your connection
at that airport.

00:10:49.015 --> 00:10:51.817
The fitness company Peloton
recalled two of its treadmills

00:10:51.817 --> 00:10:53.352
yesterday
after dozens of injuries

00:10:53.352 --> 00:10:55.253
involving children
were reported.

00:10:55.253 --> 00:10:59.858
That's crazy. Who can afford
a Peloton and children?

00:10:59.858 --> 00:11:01.827
A woman in Missouri
recently discovered

00:11:01.827 --> 00:11:04.363
a World War II-era Japanese bomb
while gardening,

00:11:04.363 --> 00:11:07.199
which came as a surprise because
she planted cruise missiles.

00:11:07.199 --> 00:11:08.534
[ Laughter ]

00:11:08.534 --> 00:11:10.936
Employees of a coronavirus
testing facility

00:11:10.936 --> 00:11:13.071
at an Indonesian airport
were arrested yesterday

00:11:13.071 --> 00:11:15.007
for allegedly washing
and reusing

00:11:15.007 --> 00:11:17.042
nasal swabs for passengers.

